{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_045_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:0446b015b424d8a992ca6e331626cb014858c49ef7b6e1c91cedb8818e0ce9b6",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_045_22:5_02_045_22_a:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db276254958d4d98ba302b384e09b1ee053df41dd385bf01c87ac74ae79d6da5",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー～。\n给，请收下～。这是情人节的回礼哦～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_045_22:5_02_045_22_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3600102e1a9da28228789d5be6ae383399d5ee13c3c2377d36263b3405c5aeb2",
      "text": "收到的巧克力，真的超级美味呢～。\n整个人都涌出力气了哦～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_045_22:5_02_045_22_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ee4a220eac7adbaff99355639838fc117db3de4524965b605137bf77457b55e",
      "text": "多亏了那盒巧克力，我也得以在工作上好好努力了呢～。\n呵呵，开玩笑的啦～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_045_22:5_02_045_22_a:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0da877b5055c572b8779133b32b25c238fb2ed1b9a40679188ce14af2fc81f96",
      "text": "制作人在工作上全力以赴虽说是好事，\n但也要适度休息哦～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_045_22:5_02_045_22_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6993163ad771455183d7b229c27f69773abb356fbd4474625bd8c6d7ecf91a6c",
      "text": "要是我的这份回礼能哪怕让制作人恢复一点活力\n就好啦～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_045_22:5_02_045_22_b:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d752f0934c8e89579a623f3ea217551b35b777683bbc86963245a85341da64f",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー～，\n辛苦啦～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_045_22:5_02_045_22_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e78530b5fab5a6003ebac821db00ebd00d3d1dba4bd8950a7709c2f6b39aab3",
      "text": "今天的拍摄也能顺顺利利地结束真是太好啦～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_045_22:5_02_045_22_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72f39a17476b1999a72591fd3193b0face577ea007f77cac8cf9a6e6b2b7b14e",
      "text": "……对了，要送的话就是趁现在了吧～。\n稍微等我一下哦～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_045_22:5_02_045_22_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a69bed39d5c12b32f00e40a078dcb569cff382b5bbb4820efd30a7a1145af975",
      "text": "来，这个。\n是情人节的回礼哦～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_045_22:5_02_045_22_b:cmd-000038:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7e8266a78304c6acc523897738228ba5aeafedf9dbc31f8042cd8b7897ef1e8",
      "text": "非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_045_22:5_02_045_22_b:cmd-000039:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bba86c2d9071411b569f3659a92bc0afa56dd9bc3f34e168781c7b0650cebfe9",
      "text": "我会好好珍惜着带回家的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_045_22:5_02_045_22_b:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af41cb696d867fe3f8acb7fd3bc3f875680f1bee1a8fb9e1c7eb1044b875c0cb",
      "text": "呵呵，你能高兴太好啦～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_045_22:5_02_045_22_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d630ba42e60bbacff05d12335f381e11a37089a2180759f9f1677fbcbb6db4e2",
      "text": "我想不管送什么，只要是送给制作人的话\n你都肯定会开心的吧～？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_045_22:5_02_045_22_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:048f5662180e2f9737542b684723fe653c586d86e47a4d91f01b15179bc2bf1f",
      "text": "不过，反正都要送，当然希望能送一份让你开心的礼物嘛～。\n所以我稍微纠结了一下哦～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_045_22:5_02_045_22_b:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0021e864575e76dbc10be3aaa8a87cd6623f28fc5e1e7fbba0985a593c5dccb6",
      "text": "里面是什么，等回去之后再确认吧～。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_045_22:5_02_045_22_b:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e055bb17edf244af5e8c5bcf211b117d093115686c4a8a6659635ce49f075470",
      "text": "呵呵，今后也请多关照啦～，\n●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
